      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Government Expenditure"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bgr6kpr",
      "content": "Government expenditure is divided into revenue expenditure and capital expenditure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4wludi8",
      "content": "Revenue Expenditure Examples: Salaries, subsidies, interest payments."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2lh0wom",
      "content": "Capital Expenditure Examples: Infrastructure projects, roads, dams."
    },
    {
